{"unit_id": "tag:0BX8:proof", "translation": "注意，<MATH_0001>的任意稠密开集（dense open）都包含点（points）<MATH_0002>，所以这个构造有意义。为证明（1）或（2），可以用任意稠密开集（dense open）替换<MATH_0003>。因此，若<MATH_0004>是<MATH_0005>的不可约分支（irreducible components），则可将<MATH_0006>替换为<MATH_0007>。这样做以后，<MATH_0008>就是其不可约分支（irreducible components）的不交并（disjoint union），这些分支视为同时也是开的闭子概形（closed subschemes）。于是，箭头（arrow）的右端和左端都是积（products），其指标均为各不可约分支（irreducible components）。这样就归约到<MATH_0009>不可约（irreducible）的情形。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n设<MATH_0010>不可约（irreducible），其泛点（generic point）<MATH_0011>位于<MATH_0012>之上。第（1）项由引理<REF_0001>的第（1）项得出。第（2）项和第（3）项由同一引理的第（2）项得出。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "dense open", "target_term": "稠密开集"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "dense open", "target_term": "稠密开集"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支"}, {"source_term": "disjoint union", "target_term": "不交并"}, {"source_term": "closed subschemes", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "arrow", "target_term": "箭头"}, {"source_term": "products", "target_term": "积"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支"}, {"source_term": "irreducible", "target_term": "不可约"}, {"source_term": "irreducible", "target_term": "不可约"}, {"source_term": "generic point", "target_term": "泛点"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "dense open", "target_term": "稠密开集", "context": "指概形中任意包含所列各点的稠密开集。"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点", "context": "指每个稠密开集所包含的那些点。"}, {"source_term": "dense open", "target_term": "稠密开集", "context": "指在证明第（1）或第（2）项时可用于替换的任意稠密开集。"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支", "context": "指替换前所列出的不可约分支。"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支", "context": "指替换后组成不交并的不可约分支。"}, {"source_term": "disjoint union", "target_term": "不交并", "context": "描述替换后各不可约分支组成的并。"}, {"source_term": "closed subschemes", "target_term": "闭子概形", "context": "将不交并的各分支视为同时也开的闭子概形。"}, {"source_term": "arrow", "target_term": "箭头", "context": "指所考察映射的箭头。"}, {"source_term": "products", "target_term": "积", "context": "指箭头两端以各不可约分支为指标所取的积。"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支", "context": "指两端的积所用的指标。"}, {"source_term": "irreducible", "target_term": "不可约", "context": "指经归约后所需处理的情形。"}, {"source_term": "irreducible", "target_term": "不可约", "context": "是下一段开头对概形的假设。"}, {"source_term": "generic point", "target_term": "泛点", "context": "指不可约概形的泛点。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01RT:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。<TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0002>上的有理函数（rational function）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是从<MATH_0003>到<MATH_0004>的有理映射（map）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "rational function", "target_term": "有理函数"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指给定的定义对象。"}, {"source_term": "rational function", "target_term": "有理函数", "context": "指在概形上定义的术语。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指从给定源到给定靶的有理映射中的映射。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01RR:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n见《构造》一章的定义<REF_0001>，其中给出了仿射（affine）直线（line）<MATH_0001>的定义。设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的概形（scheme）。对任意开集（open）<MATH_0004>，态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>与<MATH_0006>这一态射（morphism）等同，后者在<MATH_0007>之上。因此，有理函数（function）也等同于<MATH_0008>-有理映射（map），其源为<MATH_0009>，靶为<MATH_0010>。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n回顾一下，以下典范（canonical）等同（identification）\n<MATH_0011>\n对任意概形（scheme）<MATH_0012>都成立，见《概形（Schemes）》一章的例<REF_0002>。因此，<MATH_0013>是一个环（ring）对象（object），所在范畴（category）为概形（schemes）范畴。更确切地说，态射（morphisms）\n<MATH_0014>\n满足环（ring）的加法（addition）与乘法（multiplication）的所有公理（axioms）（照例，该环是交换（commutative）的，并且有<MATH_0015>）。因此，到<MATH_0016>的有理映射（maps）所成的集合（set）也具有自然的环结构（ring structure）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "line", "target_term": "直线"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "function", "target_term": "函数"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "identification", "target_term": "等同"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "addition", "target_term": "加法"}, {"source_term": "multiplication", "target_term": "乘法"}, {"source_term": "axioms", "target_term": "公理"}, {"source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "ring structure", "target_term": "环结构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "修饰所引用定义中的直线。"}, {"source_term": "line", "target_term": "直线", "context": "指引用定义中的仿射直线。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指给定底上的概形。"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "指任意选取作为态射定义域的开集。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指等同关系中先给出的态射。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指等同关系中在指定对象之上的态射。"}, {"source_term": "function", "target_term": "函数", "context": "指与相应有理映射等同的有理函数。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指带有指定底的有理映射。"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范", "context": "修饰所回顾的等同。"}, {"source_term": "identification", "target_term": "等同", "context": "指对任意概形成立的典范等同。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指典范等同适用的任意概形。"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指所引例子所在的章节名。"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "指环对象所满足的代数结构类型。"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象", "context": "指概形范畴中带有环结构的对象。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "指该环对象所处的范畴。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指上述范畴的对象是概形。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指满足所列环公理的态射。"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "指加法与乘法须满足其公理的环。"}, {"source_term": "addition", "target_term": "加法", "context": "指环的加法运算。"}, {"source_term": "multiplication", "target_term": "乘法", "context": "指环的乘法运算。"}, {"source_term": "axioms", "target_term": "公理", "context": "指相关态射满足的环公理。"}, {"source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换", "context": "描述这里的环所满足的交换性。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指以给定对象为靶的有理映射。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指上述各有理映射所成的集合。"}, {"source_term": "ring structure", "target_term": "环结构", "context": "指有理映射集合上的自然环结构。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01RU:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。<TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0002>上的有理函数环（ring of rational functions）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是环（ring）<MATH_0003>，其元素（elements）为有理函数（functions），加法（addition）和乘法（multiplication）如上所述。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "ring of rational functions", "target_term": "有理函数环"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "functions", "target_term": "函数"}, {"source_term": "addition", "target_term": "加法"}, {"source_term": "multiplication", "target_term": "乘法"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指给定的定义对象。"}, {"source_term": "ring of rational functions", "target_term": "有理函数环", "context": "指在给定概形上所定义的环。"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "指公式所记的环。"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素", "context": "指该环的成员。"}, {"source_term": "functions", "target_term": "函数", "context": "指构成该环元素的有理函数。"}, {"source_term": "addition", "target_term": "加法", "context": "指沿用前文描述的加法。"}, {"source_term": "multiplication", "target_term": "乘法", "context": "指沿用前文描述的乘法。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01RR:prose-0004", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n对于只有有限多个不可约分支（irreducible components）的概形（schemes），我们可以计算这个环。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支", "context": "指假设数目有限的不可约分支。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指可作上述计算的概形。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01RV:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme），其不可约分支（irreducible components）只有有限多个，记为<MATH_0002>。若<MATH_0003>为泛点（generic point），则\n<MATH_0004>\n若<MATH_0005>是既约（reduced）的，则所得结果等于<MATH_0006>。若<MATH_0007>是整（integral）的，则<MATH_0008>是一个域（field）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支"}, {"source_term": "generic point", "target_term": "泛点"}, {"source_term": "reduced", "target_term": "既约"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指引理中具有有限多个不可约分支的对象。"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支", "context": "指上述概形的有限多个分支。"}, {"source_term": "generic point", "target_term": "泛点", "context": "指出现在计算公式的条件中的点。"}, {"source_term": "reduced", "target_term": "既约", "context": "是计算结果等于下一个式子的条件。"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "是结论为域的条件。"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "指在整的情形下所得结果的代数结构。"}], "notes": []}
